WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.344
The framework every Vanderbilt manager shares.

2
00:00:04.394 --> 00:00:11.219
Management is behavior, not a title, and behavior can be named, measured, and practiced.

3
00:00:11.269 --> 00:00:15.907
Vanderbilt uses Gary Yukl’s taxonomy of leadership behavior,

4
00:00:15.957 --> 00:00:23.407
published in 2012 in the Academy of Management Perspectives: four categories, fifteen behaviors,

5
00:00:23.457 --> 00:00:27.236
each category defined by the objective it serves.

6
00:00:27.286 --> 00:00:33.017
Category one, task-oriented: accomplish the work efficiently and reliably.

7
00:00:33.067 --> 00:00:36.923
Planning, clarifying, monitoring, problem solving.

8
00:00:36.973 --> 00:00:40.908
Example: goals written where the team can see them,

9
00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:45.518
and progress checked in the one-on-one before the deadline.

10
00:00:45.568 --> 00:00:52.393
Category two, relations-oriented: build the quality of the people and the relationships.

11
00:00:52.443 --> 00:00:56.143
Supporting, developing, recognizing, empowering.

12
00:00:56.193 --> 00:01:01.378
Example: praise that names the person and the act, within the week.

13
00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:08.409
Category three, change-oriented: increase innovation, collective learning, and adaptation.

14
00:01:08.459 --> 00:01:15.910
Advocating change, envisioning change, encouraging innovation, facilitating collective learning.

15
00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:24.347
Example: the why explained in your own words before the announcement, and a ten-minute debrief written down.

16
00:01:24.397 --> 00:01:32.317
Category four, external: get the team the information and resources it needs and defend its interests.

17
00:01:32.367 --> 00:01:35.910
Networking, external monitoring, representing.

18
00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:40.754
Example: knowing your HR partner by name before you need them.

19
00:01:40.804 --> 00:01:46.848
A good manager does all four. A great manager knows which one this week needs.

20
00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:53.880
The Managerial Practices Survey you will receive measures exactly these fifteen behaviors.

21
00:01:53.930 --> 00:02:00.365
Now tap each category on the page to open it, then turn the page for the first one.

